# D2b tier 1: the font files carried in the binary (the core), as basename patterns (one `*`
# each) matched against the pinned file list (scripts/texlive/files.tsv). Every other pinned
# font file is in a font pack (scripts/texlive/packs.tsv, `rushtex fonts install <pack>`).
# The core is chosen by measured use (2026-11-02): over docs/master.tex, the five
# scripts/bench documents and the 302 native templates of the regression kit, every file
# master.tex and the bench documents read, and every file at least 3 of the 309 documents
# (1%) read; with Computer Modern and the AMS fonts whole. It covers 282 of the 309 fully
# (all fonts carried); the rest need a pack.
#
# Computer Modern and the AMS fonts (text, math, symbols, Fraktur), the maths fonts the
# native packages use (rsfs for mathrsfs's \mathscr, lasy for latexsym), and the encodings
# the carried fonts' map lines name.
cm*.pfb
msam*.pfb
msbm*.pfb
eu*.pfb
rsfs*.pfb
lasy*.pfb
lm-*.enc
8r.enc
cm-super-t1.enc
cm-super-ts1.enc
# LaTeX's picture fonts (`picture` lines and circles, amsfonts' latxfont Type 1 programs, as
# pdftex.map names them): line10, linew10 (\thicklines), lcircle1 and lcirclew.
line*.pfb
lcircle*.pfb
# The maths fonts pdfTeX draws as PK bitmaps (Type 3), the pinned pdftex.map having no line
# for them: dsfont's dsrom, bbm, bbold, esint, stmaryrd and wasysym's wasy, at the
# resolutions pdfTeX has used on the pinning machine (mktexpk, mode ljfour, 600 dpi base;
# the files are that machine's METAFONT output, pinned in files.tsv). A size not carried
# makes the native job decline, naming the file (`engine_doc::run`). 180 KB in all.
dsrom*pk
bbm*pk
bbold*pk
esint*pk
stmary*pk
wasy*pk
# Latin Modern (lmodern, T1 text), by measured use.
lmbx10.pfb
lmbx12.pfb
lmbx9.pfb
lmcsc10.pfb
lmex10.pfb
lmmi10.pfb
lmmi12.pfb
lmmi8.pfb
lmr10.pfb
lmr12.pfb
lmr17.pfb
lmr8.pfb
lmr9.pfb
lmri10.pfb
lmri12.pfb
lmri9.pfb
lmro10.pfb
lmss10.pfb
lmss17.pfb
lmss8.pfb
lmss9.pfb
lmssbx10.pfb
lmsy10.pfb
lmsy8.pfb
lmtt10.pfb
# cm-super (the EC fonts of `[T1]{fontenc}`, and article's TS1 text font: tcrm1000 is
# sfrm1000 through its TS1 encoding), by measured use.
sfbx0900.pfb
sfbx1000.pfb
sfbx1095.pfb
sfbx1200.pfb
sfbx1440.pfb
sfbx1728.pfb
sfbx2074.pfb
sfbx2488.pfb
sfrm0600.pfb
sfrm0800.pfb
sfrm0900.pfb
sfrm1000.pfb
sfrm1095.pfb
sfrm1200.pfb
sfrm1440.pfb
sfrm1728.pfb
sfss0900.pfb
sfti1000.pfb
sfti1095.pfb
sftt1000.pfb
sftt1095.pfb
# URW Times (master.tex's `\fontfamily{ptm}`).
utmb8a.pfb
utmbi8a.pfb
utmr8a.pfb
utmri8a.pfb
# The programs stored plain, ready to subset (`plain` lines): every font file master.tex and
# the five benchmark documents read, and those at least 10% of the 309 documents read.
# Inflating a compressed program costs about 45 instructions a byte, so these are copied
# instead; every other program is stored compressed (about half its size) and inflated only
# when a document uses it.
